### Get all products
GET http://localhost:8119/api/analytics/products

### Get revenue by category
GET http://localhost:8119/api/analytics/revenue

### Get product ranking by revenue
GET http://localhost:8119/api/analytics/ranking

### Get top performing products
GET http://localhost:8119/api/analytics/top

### Batch insert sales
POST http://localhost:8119/api/analytics/sales/batch
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "productId": 1,
    "quantity": 10,
    "saleDate": "2024-03-10",
    "revenue": 9990.00
  },
  {
    "productId": 2,
    "quantity": 5,
    "saleDate": "2024-03-11",
    "revenue": 3995.00
  }
]
